  "evidence": "TEXT_E: Pledges “safer communities,” adds 6,000 police recruits, and reforms the criminal justice system to improve detection and punishment; stresses economic stability and order; engages fully in Europe and supports enlargement; commits to action on global poverty and climate change. TEXT_G: Backs proportional representation and a written constitution; lowers the voting age to 16, implements UNCRC, and establishes a Children’s Commissioner; adopts humanitarian asylum (“fast and fair” and opposes vouchers); advances strong environmentalism (renewables targets, no new nuclear); supports EU membership and considers euro entry; opposes US missile defence, removes nuclear weapons, and phases withdrawal from NATO; also funds 1,000 more police and tightens supervision of high‑risk offenders.",
